# 8. AUTOMATIC STAFF AND DEPARTMENT ASSIGNMENT

Automatically recommend or assign a complaint to an eligible department and staff member using:

- Complaint category
- Campus location
- Staff skills or responsibility
- Staff availability and active status
- Current assigned workload
- Configured department rules

Use deterministic assignment rules as the baseline. AI can assist with classification and recommendations, but must not be the sole source of authorization or assignment logic.

If no suitable staff member is available:
- Keep the complaint in an unassigned queue.
- Notify the appropriate administrator.
- Make the assignment status visible.
- Do not silently mark the complaint as assigned.

Allow administrators to override assignments and record the reason.

Record assignment and reassignment events in the complaint history.

